I know the answer because I'm one of the owners but that's the only public
information I have right to tell.
And given the records of LLG or BPFK publicly available I can't see this
group has ever been affiliated with BPFK or LLG. This is simply a group of
people interested in Lojban, kinda club.

That BPFK or LLG or some of its members think that a "group" has any
conflict they can contact it via the addresses provided. If BPFK or LLG
thinks that it violates some trademarks etc. they can contact github.com
owners or sue github.com so that the group is blocked or its ownership is
transferred.



